sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser
  participant GW as Gateway
  participant C as Core
  B->>GW: POST /auth/login (tenantSlug, email, password)
  GW->>C: forward + X-Correlation-Id
  C->>C: resolve tenant by slug, verify BCrypt
  C-->>B: JWT (sub, tid, roles, jti)
  B->>GW: request + Bearer JWT
  GW->>GW: signature and expiry pre-check, rate limit
  GW->>C: forward
  C->>C: verify, revocation check, set TenantContext, authorize role
  C-->>B: response (404 for other-tenant ids)
